+{"id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.1.6.1","title":"Account for imposed heating in native NSF flow energy balances","description":"The native NSF SourceFn changes conserved total energy, but its ledger omits supplied source energy and labels pure heating as viscosity. Account for exactly the source quadrature already used by the solver in step and cumulative balances; keep mass/momentum-source internal exchange explicitly unresolved.","acceptance_criteria":"Heating, cooling and time-varying source balances close independently; uniform mechanical forcing is not called viscous heating; source-free states and failed-step rollback remain unchanged.","notes":"Implementation committed directly to main: 215a11c0fc4576b3668f990375f3a2d9340957bc. Native NSF ledgers now integrate the exact applied source-energy quadrature, remove supplied heat from viscous heating and report unresolved manufactured-source mechanical exchange without using it as conservation credit. Added signed heating/cooling, mechanical forcing, cumulative/replay regressions; existing rollback regression covers the extended ledger. Available nightly-2026-08-31 rustfmt parsing and focused git diff --check passed. Native cargo test -p fs-lbm --test nsf3_thermochemical is pending: constellation preflight reports all seven pinned sibling checkouts missing and shared-disk exhaustion prevents bootstrap. Remains in_progress; no passing native test or broad MR06/MR07 completion is claimed.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"bug","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:17:08.888079251Z","created_by":"frankensim-integration-agent","updated_at":"2026-10-26T01:32:07.621515384Z","source_repo":"frankensim","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["material-integration","material-reality-2026"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.1.6.1","depends_on_id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.1.6","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:17:08.888079251Z","created_by":"frank