+{"id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.5.3.1","title":"Connect sourced Maxwell wall relaxation to native acoustic DG","description":"Connect the existing source-bound generalized-Maxwell wall law to the existing DG operator with reciprocal stress memory, stored energy, dissipation and pressure ports. Preserve the current uniform cylinder/gas model limits and source band. This bounded continuation does not depend on unimplemented wood or crystal datasets.","acceptance_criteria":"Existing Maxwell source data changes native pressure/wall trajectories; zero-arm equivalence, relaxing-mode and power-balance regressions pass.","notes":"Implementation committed directly to main: 7161a318a6056e2ff99409415ff293d83bac6d7b. LocalMaterialWall now binds retained GeneralizedMaxwell source arms into native DG pressure/wall dynamics, with reciprocal branch force, spring energy and relaxation dissipation; gas memory, ports, zero-spectrum identity and the state cap are preserved. Added relaxing-mode, combined-loss/passivity, admission and material-only relaxation-time regressions. Available nightly-2026-08-31 rustfmt parsing/formatting and focused git diff --check passed. Native fs-duct and material_duct_wall tests are pending the seven missing pinned constellation siblings and shared-disk capacity. Remains in_progress; no broad MR33 closure or native test success is claimed.","status":"in_progress","priority":1,"issue_type":"feature","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:16:31.182652216Z","created_by":"frankensim-integration-agent","updated_at":"2026-10-26T01:32:15.689834450Z","source_repo":"frankensim","compaction_level":0,"original_size":0,"labels":["material-integration","material-reality-2026"],"dependencies":[{"issue_id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.5.3.1","depends_on_id":"frankensim-material-reality-ui2if.5.3","type":"parent-child","created_at":"2026-10-26T01:16:31.182652216Z","created_by":"frankensim-integration-agent","metadata":"{}","thread_id":""}]}
